WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:06,720
Do you want to invite Chairman Wen back?

2
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:07,720
Not yet

3
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:09,080
To replace the entire enchantment

4
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:10,480
Only Wenwen has experience

5
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:11,480
Wait a moment

6
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:13,680
We can't even stop a few demons.

7
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:20,290
Completely different from indoors

8
00:00:20,290 --> 00:00:21,450
real battlefield

9
00:00:21,450 --> 00:00:25,210
I won’t give you a fixed handle and a stable environment. Look first and then judge.

10
00:00:25,210 --> 00:00:26,610
The last thing is shooting

11
00:00:26,610 --> 00:00:27,890
Accuracy is sufficient

12
00:00:27,890 --> 00:00:29,370
What is lacking is practical experience

13
00:00:29,370 --> 00:00:30,460
First comer

14
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:31,580
I am number one

15
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:36,390
Not a hotel

16
00:00:36,390 --> 00:00:38,470
Why do you still have to queue up? I don’t like it.

17
00:00:38,470 --> 00:00:40,580
Can refuse

18
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:41,540
rare opportunity

19
00:00:41,540 --> 00:00:44,330
I also want to see what level I am at.

20
00:00:44,450 --> 00:00:45,850
Overall strength is average

21
00:00:45,850 --> 00:00:46,810
Use all means

22
00:00:46,810 --> 00:00:48,330
It is difficult for people below the director level to defeat him.

23
00:00:48,330 --> 00:00:49,530
Where is the ghost you let out yesterday?
